<p>Hello SCP Wiki Forums!</p>
<p>I've recently taken an interest in this place when SCP animation videos started showing up in my YouTube feed, particularly ones from the spin-off channel of the Infographics channel. Technically, I've known about the existence of SCPs since around 2014, courtesy of Tumblr, but I've never really thought of actually trying to write stories set in the SCP Universe until now.</p>
<p>Right now, I have a weird idea for an SCP based around the tragedy of Actaeon, that curses those who activate it with Cervocephaly (deer headedness) and causes all dogs nearby to want to kill them, and I'm already starting to think up a narrative for its discovery by the Foundation. It's sort of festive, since it is the time of year for (sleigh pulling) deer after all, and maybe if I'm lucky I'll at least have a draft published in my sandbox before Christmas.</p>

